Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.07,0:01:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I enjoyed celebrating spring Amid\Nthe flowering cherry blossoms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved breathing in the fragrance\Nof fresh green leaves as I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we would always live our whole\Nlives with nature at our fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.99,0:02:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With me, Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our objective is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should leave Shikoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you head back\Nwithout me, Jouryuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay here and watch a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That other Shuki is pretty\Nstrong, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna see how this all plays out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus.
