Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned how to step up my game\Nduring our training sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have something worth fighting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could even channel my\Nstrength into my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of like this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.99,0:05:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see that you're extremely angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because my rage burns\Na hundred times water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mechuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where you perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The technique I learned\Nto carve you into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling cherry blossom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No countering or dodging me this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the unyielding king of my blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come to bow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyouka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go gather up the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is for my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was quite the spectacular battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commander of the 7th squadron\Nis pretty impressive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find him quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a few scratches i'll heal quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh miss tenka hey everyone you\Ndidn't have to come back right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a family issue\Nso i have to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't have to worry about the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ney's doing a great job\Nhandling the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:08:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't say i feel like leading\Na revolt the shuki we rallied
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are gone plus they abducted coco\Nnan but i still have to save them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you willing to let me protect\Nyou if you don't plan on causing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trouble there's no need for us\Nto keep fighting you're a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a Mato mishap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can\Nto rescue your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.07,0:08:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't let the Onmyou Bureau\Ntouch you either. Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust Tenka and Kyoka, but I can't trust\Nthe organization? as a whole. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stay here anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got other villages, and my\Nfriends are already on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my job to look after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.01,0:08:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they have somewhere to hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then choosing not to accept our\Noffer would be a sensible decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.87,0:09:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander Yamashiro, if the Onmyou\NBureau is conducting these experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is a decent chance\Nshe is already aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Commander of\Nthe Demon Defense Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why does that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's reassuring to have a Supreme\NCommander who's so patriotic,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she's a little unnerving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't bring myself to\Nattack Alba during our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Supreme Commander\Nwouldn't have hesitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether something's right\Nor wrong, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just how she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why hiding might actually\Nbe a safer option at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, our conversations\Nhaven't left this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can investigate the Onyo Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, how long will my sister\Nand her friends have to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an easy one. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.45,0:10:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haine, we're back from...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe everyone else for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are Himari and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be cleared to come back\Nafter two or three days of bed rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm off to get my\Ninjuries looked at as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll check on Himari and the\Nothers while I'm in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Tenka! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time we're alone, I\Nexpect a very generous reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nei has to go drop off a\Nchange of clothes for Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari and Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:10:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please feel free to unwind in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki, stand by in your Slave form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come get me at the\Nfirst sign of an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you up to eating some dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in any pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just... the others are...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Demon Defense Force has\Na talented medical team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll bounce back soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what Miss Kyouka said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If something happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's your job to work extra hard on\Nbehalf of everyone who's in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So eat something when you\Ncan, and try to cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Senpai's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I'll go grab you some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, take your time, and be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm your senpai, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm disengaging my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go rinse off in the shower\Nbefore your reward begins. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you're finished, meet me in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, your reward is\Nsleeping in my bed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, alrighty then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.41,0:13:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that rest is important, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lack of clothing is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be exhausted if you don't get\Nsome sleep and the reward won't end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel wide awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, perhaps we\Nshould do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit still, trust me on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The price of my ability only\Nlets me move so far, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is the point of this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make sure you understand\Nthat I am your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.79,0:13:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I am fully aware of that fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except you ignored my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then obeyed your sister instead\Nand got yourself captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a knee-jerk\Nreaction, it's an old habit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said your sister always used\Nto put you in a headlock rack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need extensive disciplining, but\NI'll start with the same method she used!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that I'm okay with\Nthis is a little concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring two of them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For when the time comes that it\Ndecides to be picky about its food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spoil that damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, it does need food to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only god that ever has.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just means it's going\Nto be a powerful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.11,0:14:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get to live forever inside a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.93,0:15:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This seems promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our newest friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look, she's about to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To celebrate your return and as\Na way of showing my gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we pulled out all the stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is one of Yuki's famous meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks and smells delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make ramen with the leftover broth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you have an\Nappetite for something so low-brow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're welcome\Nto not eat it, Yachiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my responsibility to assess your taste\Nin food, no matter how disastrous it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yachi, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love that kind of stuff, and you're\Nalways sneaking snacks and sweets, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I think we\Nshould, uh... Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's raise a toast. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone grab a glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the star this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should give a speech. Huh?\NMe? Give the speech? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I want to thank each and every\None of you for coming to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something I'll never...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's up! Kanpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kanpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what should I eat first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.93,0:16:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My food is Yuki's cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and they got to help out a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely sure I\Ncan't have Yuuki? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We forgot to tell you something\Nwhile we were in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an easy one. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to become Supreme Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll change the Demon\NDefense Forces policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll exterminate the Shuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect Aoba and her friends,\Nand then find a way to cure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we might finally\Nget to rest easy. Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cave's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to leave now! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the exit together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix that for me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:17:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I will find a way to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will always fight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotten so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get an A+.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up till now, I've been fighting\Nbecause I wanted to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I have a much\Nmore important purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To cure my big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my reason for fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.55,0:18:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I expected a generous\Nreward when we were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was admiring your adorable\Nface while you slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to stay in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, given your recent absence,\Ndon't you have paperwork to catch up on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How right you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get back to this at\Na later date, okay, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka was just dropping\Nby to say hello, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That honestly was meant for you! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evidently, you still don't\Nunderstand who your master is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you already tired when\NI just called you? Sorry, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyoka really put me through the ringer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extra training?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like something she'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hone my Peach ability, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean learning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:20:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be an asset to the Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.23,0:20:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why I need your help, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.05,0:20:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient, Shushu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.81,0:20:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what you uncovered on the\Ninternet during the hospital stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The art of war applies to romance, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of vying for\Nattention, I need to act aloof.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my analysis, Yuki's\Nlove levels look something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't use my brain,\NI can't win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is all exactly as I envisioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gateway just opened up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Currently, I'm not detecting anyone\Nin need of rescue near the gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, more and more\NShuki are converging.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:21:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all counting on you. Got it? Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving, Miss Kyouka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, Yuuki! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to fall down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how I became...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of how I became a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coco...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.99,0:21:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nalan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:21:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on my life I will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
